  "slug": "protein-packed-bbq-chicken-salad-recipe-12026462",
  "name": "Protein Packed BBQ Chicken Salad",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This protein-packed BBQ chicken salad is loaded with bold barbecue flavor and couldn\u2019t be easier to make. Simply toss everything together in one bowl with a creamy Greek yogurt and mayonnaise dressing flavored with BBQ rub and BBQ sauce for an easy lunch or meal-prep favorite.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine chicken, red onion, jalapeno, BBQ sauce, cilantro, yogurt, mayonnaise, Dijon mustard, relish, and BBQ rub in a large bowl and mix well. Cover and refrigerate at least 30 minutes or until ready to serve."
    }
  ],
